     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "BMI is calculated by dividing the client’s weight by their height in inches squared and multiplying by 703: <span data-math=\"278\\;÷\\;\\;69^{2}\\;=\\;278\\;÷\\;4761\\;=\\;0.0584\\;\\times\\;703\\;=\\;41.05\"></span>, rounded to 41.1."
    }
